+ * the one this function used to ask.
+ *
+ * IT ASKED IT OF THE WRONG NUMBER. The band is four of 255 and it was compared
+ * against what the GAME asked for, while the gain that decides what the pad
+ * actually gets is applied afterwards, by the rewrite. At a strength of ten a
+ * movement of three was held as imperceptible and would have been THIRTY of 255
+ * at the motors. Measured on the traces of 2026-09-11: at x4, 358 changes held,
