+ * on the radio, which this adds none of.
+ *
+ * XInputRumbleRideBand PUTS IT BACK, 1 for the behaviour before this patch,
+ * without a rebuild and without touching the thread's band. If frames ever
+ * regress on a title, that is the one value to move, and moving it says which
+ * of this patch's two halves was wrong. */
